                        <div class="si">
                          <div class="si__list">
                            <ul class="list-unstyled">
                              <li class="si__list--single">Graduates will apply strong foundations in computer science and information technology to design, develop and deploy reliable software, data and cloud systems.</li>
                              <li class="si__list--single">Graduates will analyse and solve real-world problems using modern programming, data engineering and AI/ML techniques while considering security, ethics and sustainability.</li>
                              <li class="si__list--single">Graduates will engage in lifelong learning, professional development and entrepreneurship to thrive in a fast-evolving technology landscape.</li>
                            </ul>
